Third-party code
----------------

`src/ui.mjs` (the landing page) is copied verbatim from:

    cf-shortlink-worker
    https://github.com/Aethersailor/cf-shortlink-worker
    commit 4623ac19d93f1aef361d0825b7aada9a50ee91da
    Copyright (c) 2025 Aethersailor
    Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPLv3)

It was extracted from `landingHtml()` in that project's `worker.js`: the
`<style>` block, the three i18n dictionaries, the page markup, and the
client-side script.

Modifications made while importing it (also listed in the file header of
`src/ui.mjs`, as required by AGPL-3.0 section 5):

    D1  Configuration values are HTML-escaped / URL-encoded, and the i18n
        dictionary is serialized with "<" and ">" escaped, instead of being
        interpolated raw.
    D2  An optional access-token field is rendered only when CREATE_TOKEN is
        configured, and its value is sent as an `Authorization: Bearer` header.
        Two dictionary keys (`tokenLabel`, `tokenRequired`) were added in all
        three languages to support it.
    D3  Footer copy and the "open source" link point at this project instead of
        the upstream deployment.
    D4  `<meta name="robots" content="noindex">` was added to the `<head>`.
    D5  `sessionStorage` reads and writes are wrapped in try/catch so blocked
        storage cannot break the page.
    D6  Client requests are prefixed with the configured `ACCESS_KEY` path, and
        the 404 page omits its "back home" link while an access key is set, so
        the key can never leak through it.

Everything else in this repository — the HTTP core, the Aliyun ESA Edge KV
adapter, the ESA entry point, the single-file bundler, the local preview server,
the test suite and the documentation — is original work.


